      de: ["Fläche der Region beträgt etwa 67.800 Quadratkilometer.", "Die Provinzhauptstadt Rosso liegt direkt am Senegal-Fluss.", "Produziert über 70% des im Inland konsumierten Reises.", "Heimat des Diawling-Nationalparks, gegründet 1991.", "Wichtigstes Zentrum für die Gewinnung von Gummi arabicum.", "Grenzstation Rosso verarbeitet jährlich Tausende von Tonnen Fracht.", "Region unterteilt sich in 6 Departements (Moughataas).", "Niederschlagsmenge variiert zwischen 150 mm und 300 mm pro Jahr."],
      hu: ["A régió területe megközelítőleg 67 800 km².", "A lakosság száma meghaladja a 270 000 főt.", "Rosso városa a legfontosabb határátkelőhely Szenegál felé.", "Itt található az ország rizstermő területeinek 80%-a.", "A Diawling Nemzeti Park 16 000 hektáron terül el.", "A régióban több mint 1 millió állat (marha, teve) él.", "A történelmi Trarza Emirátust a 17. században alapították.", "Az akácfaerdők adják az ország gumiarábikum exportjának zömét."],
      ro: ["Suprafața regiunii este de circa 67.800 km².", "Populația este estimată la aproximativ 272.773 de locuitori.", "Capitala regională Rosso se află la 204 km de Nouakchott.", "Parcul Național Diawling găzduiește peste 220 de specii de păsări.", "Economia depinde în proporție de 60% de sectorul agropastoral.", "Fluviul Senegal formează granița sudică pe o lungime de sute de km.", "Regiunea este împărțită în 6 districte administrative.", "Altitudinea medie este foarte joasă, sub 50 de metri deasupra mării."],
      en: ["Covers an area of approximately 67,800 square kilometers.", "Rosso serves as the administrative and commercial capital.", "Responsible for nearly 80% of Mauritania's domestic rice production.", "The Diawling National Park was established as a buffer zone in 1991.", "Annual average rainfall is approximately 200 mm in the southern part.", "The region consists of 6 departments (Moughataas).", "Historically dominated by the Trarza Emirate for over three centuries.", "Major projects include the Rosso Bridge construction to replace ferries."],
